{"4990590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Split Second Volley", "steam_appid": 4990590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALPHA DEMO COMING VERY SOON!!! Wishlist now to get notified!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split Second Volley is a Turn-Based volley ball game that let's you create intense, anime-style sports scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw you ally to reach the ball at the last second, split it into 3 using &quot;Illusion Ball&quot;, and use your Gun to shoot it while its in the air to shift its course - ANYTHING is possible when everyone is moving in bullet time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, everything plays out in real-time so you can see just how badass you really were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 1v1 online (controlling both Support and Attack characters) or 2v2 with a friend (each one controlling their own character). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or practice combos and get the hang of everything in Sandbox mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a battle of minds, quick thinking, and ingenuity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE CLASSES AND SKILLS COMING SOON!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALPHA DEMO COMING VERY SOON!!! Wishlist now to get notified!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split Second Volley is a Turn-Based volley ball game that let's you create intense, anime-style sports scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw you ally to reach the ball at the last second, split it into 3 using &quot;Illusion Ball&quot;, and use your Gun to shoot it while its in the air to shift its course - ANYTHING is possible when everyone is moving in bullet time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each round, everything plays out in real-time so you can see just how badass you really were.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play 1v1 online (controlling both Support and Attack characters) or 2v2 with a friend (each one controlling their own character). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or practice combos and get the hang of everything in Sandbox mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a battle of minds, quick thinking, and ingenuity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MORE CLASSES AND SKILLS COMING SOON!</p>", "short_description": "Turn based anime-style sports battles! Create outrageous combos and last minute saves using teamwork and unique skills. You can even use guns! Outsmart your foes, choreograph larger than life moments, and win PvP battles with STYLE! ", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4990590/724088aca444b6568be2fbb8473388be654691e6/header.jpg?t=1786640063", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4990590/bfbdbb5c4b598c1178565228ebcb03bcde101601/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786640063", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4990590/bfbdbb5c4b598c1178565228ebcb03bcde101601/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786640063", "website": "https://www.jimjum.io", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Jimjum Studios"], "publishers": ["Jimjum Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id":